flowchart TB
    IN["<b>INPUT — code with known answers</b><br/>Synthetic VB.NET + SQL Server modules (AP invoices, JC change orders, ~2.5K lines each)<br/>Hidden answer keys: 99 known rules · 26 planted problems · Q&A / change-impact / app-requirement sets"]
    PIPE["<b>SYSTEM UNDER TEST</b><br/>Spec-distillation pipeline · Claude Opus 5.5 / Sonnet 5.5 on Amazon Bedrock"]
    OUT["<b>OUTPUT being evaluated</b><br/>Business spec · Issues & Insights · Knowledge graph · Code graph"]

    EX["<b>EXACT — no AI, same result every time</b><br/>✓ every source line read once<br/>✓ every citation points at a real line<br/>✓ graph links confirmed by real parsers (Roslyn · ScriptDOM)<br/>✓ structure: no duplicates / orphans / cycles<br/>✓ mutation test: injected defects caught"]
    JU["<b>ESTIMATED — LLM-as-a-judge (Claude on Bedrock)</b><br/>• rules found vs answer key · wrong claims<br/>• planted problems: full / partial / missed<br/>• Q&A · change impact · new-app requirements<br/><i>fixed JSON schema · cached · only relevant lines · 3 runs, majority vote</i>"]
    TR["<b>RELIABILITY</b><br/>Judge vs human labels: 87–93% agreement<br/>Run-to-run agreement κ 0.90 · 95% confidence intervals"]
    RES["<b>RESULT — scorecard in the viewer</b><br/>Exact panel + Estimated panel with error bars · cost · provenance (commit, model, corpus hash)"]

    IN -->|code only — key is hidden| PIPE --> OUT
    OUT --> EX
    OUT --> JU
    IN -. answer key .-> JU
    TR --> JU
    EX --> RES
    JU --> RES

